Yesterday morning at eight o'clock, I reached the railway station.
There was a lot of crowd at the station.
People were running here and there with their own luggage.
I looked at the big board.
My Lonavala train was on platform number four.
I quickly went to platform number four.
The train was already there.
I checked my own ticket again.
My coach was 'C-two'.
I found my coach and went inside.
A man was standing near my seat.
He was putting his bag on the upper rack.
I waited for a short time.
Then I went to my reserved window seat.
I kept my own backpack near my feet.
And I sat down comfortably.
In a short while, the train started.
I looked out the window with excitement.
